{"seq":1,"slug":"dense-retrieval","title":"稠密检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/dense-retrieval","wordCount":1677,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"稠密检索\">稠密检索</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>稠密检索（Dense Retrieval）是利用深度学习模型将查询和文档映射到连续向量空间，通过向量相似度计算实现语义级别匹配的检索范式。与传统基于词频的稀疏检索不同，稠密检索能够捕捉深层语义关系，解决词汇不匹配（Vocabulary Mismatch）问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 双塔架构&#10;        Q[查询文本] --&gt; QE[查询编码器]&#10;        D[文档文本] --&gt; DE[文档编码器]&#10;        QE --&gt; QV[查询向量 q]&#10;        DE --&gt; DV[文档向量 d]&#10;    end&#10;    QV --&gt; SIM[相似度计算]&#10;    DV --&gt; SIM&#10;    SIM --&gt; RANK[排序结果]&#10;    subgraph 离线索引&#10;        CORPUS[文档语料库] --&gt; DE2[文档编码器]&#10;        DE2 --&gt; IDX[向量索引 ANN]&#10;    end&#10;    QV --&gt; IDX&#10;    IDX --&gt; RANK\">graph TB\n    subgraph 双塔架构\n        Q[查询文本] --&gt; QE[查询编码器]\n        D[文档文本] --&gt; DE[文档编码器]\n        QE --&gt; QV[查询向量 q]\n        DE --&gt; DV[文档向量 d]\n    end\n    QV --&gt; SIM[相似度计算]\n    DV --&gt; SIM\n    SIM --&gt; RANK[排序结果]\n    subgraph 离线索引\n        CORPUS[文档语料库] --&gt; DE2[文档编码器]\n        DE2 --&gt; IDX[向量索引 ANN]\n    end\n    QV --&gt; IDX\n    IDX --&gt; RANK</pre><p>稠密检索的核心思想是在向量空间中，语义相近的文本被映射到相近的位置，从而通过最近邻搜索实现高效的语义检索。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>稠密检索</th>\n<th>稀疏检索（BM25）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>匹配方式</td>\n<td>语义匹配</td>\n<td>词汇匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表示形式</td>\n<td>低维连续向量（768维）</td>\n<td>高维稀疏向量（词表大小）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>词汇不匹配</td>\n<td>天然解决</td>\n<td>严重受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算资源</td>\n<td>GPU 编码 + ANN 检索</td>\n<td>CPU 即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可解释性</td>\n<td>较差</td>\n<td>较好（可追溯到具体词）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零样本能力</td>\n<td>依赖预训练模型质量</td>\n<td>无需训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引大小</td>\n<td>较大（浮点向量）</td>\n<td>较小（倒排索引）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"双塔编码架构\">双塔编码架构</h2><p>双塔模型（Bi-Encoder）是稠密检索最核心的架构设计。查询和文档分别通过独立的编码器生成向量表示，在推理时文档向量可以离线预计算并建立索引，查询时只需在线编码查询向量并执行近似最近邻（ANN）搜索。</p>\n<p>Bi-Encoder 的训练目标通常采用对比学习框架。给定查询 q、正样本文档 d⁺ 和负样本文档 d⁻，优化以下损失函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DenseRetrievalConfig {&#10;  queryEncoder: TransformerModel;&#10;  docEncoder: TransformerModel;&#10;  similarityFn: &#39;dot_product&#39; | &#39;cosine&#39; | &#39;l2_distance&#39;;&#10;  poolingStrategy: &#39;cls&#39; | &#39;mean&#39; | &#39;max&#39;;&#10;  embeddingDim: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TrainingBatch {&#10;  queries: string[];&#10;  positives: string[];&#10;  negatives: string[][];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function inBatchNegativeLoss(&#10;  queryEmbeds: Float32Array[],&#10;  docEmbeds: Float32Array[],&#10;  temperature: number = 0.05,&#10;): number {&#10;  const batchSize = queryEmbeds.length;&#10;  const scores: number[][] = [];&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; batchSize; i++) {&#10;    const row: number[] = [];&#10;    for (let j = 0; j &lt; batchSize; j++) {&#10;      row.push(dotProduct(queryEmbeds[i], docEmbeds[j]) / temperature);&#10;    }&#10;    scores.push(row);&#10;  }&#10;  return crossEntropyLoss(&#10;    scores,&#10;    Array.from({ length: batchSize }, (_, i) =&gt; i),&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DenseRetrievalConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TransformerModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docEncoder</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TransformerModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  similarityFn</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'dot_product'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cosine'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'l2_distance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  poolingStrategy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cls'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'mean'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'max'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  embeddingDim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TrainingBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  positives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  negatives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inBatchNegativeLoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queryEmbeds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  docEmbeds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> batchSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queryEmbeds.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scores</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batchSize; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> row</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batchSize; j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      row.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dotProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryEmbeds[i], docEmbeds[j]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scores.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(row);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crossEntropyLoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scores,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Array.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ length: batchSize }, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>双塔架构的关键设计选择包括参数共享策略、池化方法和向量维度。参数共享（Shared Encoder）在数据量有限时表现更好，而独立参数（Asymmetric Encoder）在大规模数据上可以更好地适配查询和文档的不同特征分布。</p>\n<p>CLS 池化直接取 [CLS] token 的隐藏状态作为句子表示，而均值池化（Mean Pooling）对所有 token 的隐藏状态取平均。实践中，均值池化通常能获得更稳定的表示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"负样本挖掘策略\">负样本挖掘策略</h2><p>负样本的质量直接决定了稠密检索模型的性能上界。好的负样本应该是 &quot;足够难&quot; 的——与查询有一定相关性但并非最佳答案的文档。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>负样本策略</th>\n<th>方法描述</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机负采样</td>\n<td>从语料库随机采样</td>\n<td>简单高效</td>\n<td>负样本太简单，训练信号弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BM25 负采样</td>\n<td>用 BM25 召回的非相关文档</td>\n<td>词汇层面困难</td>\n<td>可能缺少语义困难样本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>In-Batch Negatives</td>\n<td>同批次其他查询的正例</td>\n<td>无额外开销</td>\n<td>受限于 batch size</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硬负样本挖掘</td>\n<td>用当前模型检索 top-k 非相关</td>\n<td>最有效的训练信号</td>\n<td>需要定期重建索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>交叉编码器蒸馏</td>\n<td>用 Cross-Encoder 分数筛选</td>\n<td>高质量标注</td>\n<td>计算成本高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>ANCE（Approximate Nearest Neighbor Negative Contrastive Estimation）是一种经典的硬负样本挖掘方法，它周期性地使用当前训练中的模型刷新 ANN 索引，从索引中检索最相似但非正例的文档作为负样本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface HardNegativeMining {&#10;  model: DenseRetriever;&#10;  index: ANNIndex;&#10;  refreshInterval: number;&#10;  topK: number;&#10;  filterPositives: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function mineHardNegatives(&#10;  queries: string[],&#10;  positiveIds: Set&lt;string&gt;,&#10;  config: HardNegativeMining,&#10;): Promise&lt;Map&lt;string, string[]&gt;&gt; {&#10;  const queryEmbeds = await config.model.encodeQueries(queries);&#10;  const results = new Map&lt;string, string[]&gt;();&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; queries.length; i++) {&#10;    const candidates = await config.index.search(queryEmbeds[i], config.topK * 2);&#10;    const negatives = candidates&#10;      .filter((c) =&gt; !positiveIds.has(c.id))&#10;      .slice(0, config.topK)&#10;      .map((c) =&gt; c.id);&#10;    results.set(queries[i], negatives);&#10;  }&#10;  return results;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HardNegativeMining</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  model</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DenseRetriever</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  index</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ANNIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  refreshInterval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  topK</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  filterPositives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mineHardNegatives</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  queries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  positiveIds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span st