-shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queries.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.index.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queryEmbeds[i], config.topK </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> negatives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> candidates</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">filter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">positiveIds.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(c.id))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, config.topK)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(queries[i], negatives);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>实践中常采用混合负采样策略：一部分来自 BM25 负样本，一部分来自硬负样本挖掘，再加上 In-Batch Negatives，形成多梯度难度的训练信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"向量索引与近似最近邻\">向量索引与近似最近邻</h2><p>稠密检索在推理阶段的核心挑战是如何在数十亿级文档向量中高效找到最相似的向量。精确最近邻搜索的时间复杂度为 O(n)，在实际系统中不可接受，因此需要近似最近邻（ANN）算法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph ANN算法族&#10;        IVF[IVF 倒排文件索引]&#10;        HNSW[HNSW 层次图索引]&#10;        PQ[PQ 乘积量化]&#10;        LSH[LSH 局部敏感哈希]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 权衡维度&#10;        SPEED[检索速度]&#10;        RECALL[召回率]&#10;        MEM[内存占用]&#10;        BUILD[构建时间]&#10;    end&#10;    IVF --&gt; SPEED&#10;    IVF --&gt; MEM&#10;    HNSW --&gt; SPEED&#10;    HNSW --&gt; RECALL&#10;    PQ --&gt; MEM&#10;    LSH --&gt; BUILD\">graph LR\n    subgraph ANN算法族\n        IVF[IVF 倒排文件索引]\n        HNSW[HNSW 层次图索引]\n        PQ[PQ 乘积量化]\n        LSH[LSH 局部敏感哈希]\n    end\n    subgraph 权衡维度\n        SPEED[检索速度]\n        RECALL[召回率]\n        MEM[内存占用]\n        BUILD[构建时间]\n    end\n    IVF --&gt; SPEED\n    IVF --&gt; MEM\n    HNSW --&gt; SPEED\n    HNSW --&gt; RECALL\n    PQ --&gt; MEM\n    LSH --&gt; BUILD</pre><p>HNSW（Hierarchical Navigable Small World）是目前工业界最广泛使用的 ANN 算法。它构建一个多层图结构，底层包含所有节点，上层逐渐稀疏。检索时从顶层的入口节点开始，贪心搜索到每层的最近邻，然后下降到下一层继续搜索，最终在底层获得精确的近似最近邻。</p>\n<p>IVF（Inverted File Index）将向量空间划分为多个 Voronoi 区域，每个区域由一个聚类中心表示。检索时先找到最近的几个聚类中心，然后只在这些聚类内部进行精确搜索。IVF 通常与 PQ（Product Quantization）结合使用，通过将高维向量压缩为短编码来大幅减少内存占用。这些索引算法在不同语料规模下的参数调优与产品选型，会在<a href=\"../search-infrastructure/vector-databases\">向量数据库</a>一章中展开。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface IndexConfig {&#10;  type: &#39;hnsw&#39; | &#39;ivf_pq&#39; | &#39;ivf_flat&#39; | &#39;flat&#39;;&#10;  dimension: number;&#10;  metric: &#39;ip&#39; | &#39;l2&#39; | &#39;cosine&#39;;&#10;  hnswM?: number;&#10;  hnswEfConstruction?: number;&#10;  hnswEfSearch?: number;&#10;  ivfNlist?: number;&#10;  ivfNprobe?: number;&#10;  pqM?: number;&#10;  pqNbits?: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function chooseIndex(corpusSize: number, memoryBudget: number): IndexConfig {&#10;  if (corpusSize &lt; 100_000) {&#10;    return { type: &#39;flat&#39;, dimension: 768, metric: &#39;ip&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;  if (corpusSize &lt; 10_000_000) {&#10;    return {&#10;      type: &#39;hnsw&#39;,&#10;      dimension: 768,&#10;      metric: &#39;ip&#39;,&#10;      hnswM: 32,&#10;      hnswEfConstruction: 200,&#10;      hnswEfSearch: 128,&#10;    };&#10;  }&#10;  return {&#10;    type: &#39;ivf_pq&#39;,&#10;    dimension: 768,&#10;    metric: &#39;ip&#39;,&#10;    ivfNlist: Math.round(Math.sqrt(corpusSize)),&#10;    ivfNprobe: 64,&#10;    pqM: 96,&#10;    pqNbits: 8,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IndexConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hnsw'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ivf_pq'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ivf_flat'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'flat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dimension</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  metric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ip'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'l2'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cosine'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hnswM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hnswEfConstruction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  hnswEfSearch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ivfNlist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ivfNprobe</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pqM</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pqNbits</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chooseIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">corpusSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">memoryBudget</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IndexConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (corpusSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'flat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (corpusSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10_000_000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hnsw'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      hnswM: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      hnswEfConstruction: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">200</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      hnswEfSearch: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ivf_pq'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dimension: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    metric: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ip'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ivfNlist: Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(corpusSize)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ivfNprobe: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pqM: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">96</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pqNbits: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"预训练与微调范式\">预训练与微调范式</h2><p>稠密检索模型的训练通常分为预训练和微调两个阶段。预训练阶段在大规模无标注语料上学习通用的文本表示能力，微调阶段在特定检索任务的标注数据上优化检索性能。</p>\n<p>预训练方法的演进路线清晰：从 BERT 直接微调到 ICT（Inverse Cloze Task）预训练，再到 Condenser/coCondenser 的结构化预训练，以及 RetroMAE 的掩码自编码预训练。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>预训练方法</th>\n<th>关键创新</th>\n<th>MS MARCO MRR@10</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DPR</td>\n<td>无专门预训练</td>\n<td>双塔 + In-Batch Neg</td>\n<td>31.1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ANCE</td>\n<td>BM25 初始化 + 异步刷新</td>\n<td>硬负样本挖掘</td>\n<td>33.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>coCondenser</td>\n<td>跳句预测 + 聚合预训练</td>\n<td>结构化预训练</td>\n<td>38.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E5</td>\n<td>对比学习 + 指令微调</td>\n<td>大规模对比预训练</td>\n<td>43.2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BGE</td>\n<td>RetroMAE + 多阶段微调</td>\n<td>中文场景优化</td>\n<td>42.8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>微调阶段的核心策略包括知识蒸馏（从 Cross-Encoder 到 Bi-Encoder）、多任务学习（检索 + 分类 + 聚类联合训练）以及课程学习（从简单负样本逐渐过渡到困难负样本）。双塔编码器的表示质量最终取决于底层<a href=\"embedding-models\">嵌入模型</a>的训练范式与选型——两者互为表里：嵌入模型决定&quot;向量从哪来&quot;，稠密检索决定&quot;向量怎么用&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>稠密检索通过双塔编码架构将查询和文档映射到连续向量空间，实现语义级别的检索匹配</li>\n<li>负样本质量是训练效果的关键因素，混合策略（BM25 + 硬负样本 + In-Batch）效果最佳</li>\n<li>ANN 索引（HNSW、IVF-PQ）解决了大规模向量检索的效率问题，需要在速度、召回率和内存之间权衡</li>\n<li>预训练范式从通用语言模型微调演进到检索专用预训练（coCondenser、RetroMAE），显著提升了零样本和小样本场景的表现</li>\n<li>实际部署中需要综合考虑编码延迟、索引构建时间、内存占用和召回质量等工程因素</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"稠密检索","id":"稠密检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"双塔编码架构","id":"双塔编码架构"},{"level":2,"text":"负样本挖掘策略","id":"负样本挖掘策略"},{"level":2,"text":"向量索引与近似最近邻","id":"向量索引与近似最近邻"},{"level":2,"text":"预训练与微调范式","id":"预训练与微调范式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"稀疏与稠密混合检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/sparse-dense-hybrid"}}